y for his struggling family  his  mind has gone rotten when interviewed by  the fbi he can't even remember his own  name  he later hallucinates shooting geno and  members of his staff with a golden tommy  gun while in reality he shot his  gardener in the leg  another event of which there is no  record by the swamp capone sees a safe  and is reminded of the clue mona lisa  gave him  dig where it is wet but this isn't  referring to the swamp at  all dig wear it as wet is referring to  his brain the thing capone had buried  away all this time  wasn't money at all it was the key to  something much more important  his son who he had cast away capone's  last living blood relative  believes that capone's hidden money is  real and that before his stay on  alcatraz he hid millions of dollars  across  several of his properties but as the  film notes no money was ever recovered  overall capone stretches reality to the  point of unbelievability  but that's kind of the point as we  witness these events through the lens of  a man  suffering from hallucinations and  dementia it's up to us to decipher the  real  from the imaginary thanks everyone for  watching please make sure to like and  subscribe and for more bad takes check  out my other videos and follow me on  twitter at thinkstoryyt  until next time remember daddy loves you  very much

